  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Chicken quarter glistens with a golden glaze that promises crispy skin and tender, juicy meat. Toss each chicken quarter in a fragrant rub of garlic, paprika, and a hint of citrus zest, then roast until the aroma fills the kitchen and pulls everyone to the table. Every bite starts with a playful crunch and gives way to mouthwatering juices, finished with sweet honey mustard and a splash of tangy apple cider vinegar for balance. Perfect for busy weeknights or lazy weekends, chicken quarter turns simple ingredients into a flavor-packed feast that feels like a warm hug on a plate.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-chicken-quarter\">Why You’ll Love This chicken quarter</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-chicken-quarter\">How to Make Chicken Quarter</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-chicken-quarter\">Pro Tips for Making Chicken Quarter</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-chicken-quarter\">How to Serve this chicken quarter</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-chicken-quarter\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This chicken quarter</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perfectly juicy and tender every time.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Simple prep with minimal cleanup.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Flavor-packed with your favorite seasonings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for meal prep or family dinners.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Budget-friendly and satisfying for all ages.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7426\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7426\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-